Chapter: ListPatternNonexhaustive

 A List match with a Cons arm and no Nil arm and no catchall is
 non-exhaustive against the synthesized Nil/Cons view: CDX2070.

Section: Body

  first-only : List Integer -> Integer
  first-only (xs) =
   when xs
    is Cons (h) (_) -> h

  opening : Integer
  opening = first-only [3]
